my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
foo bar foo baz foo
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{:nohlsearch clears search highlights},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/nohlsearch`

**:nohlsearch** clears the current search highlights without changing the search pattern or cursor position.

**Keys:** `/foo\n` then `:nohlsearch\n`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0
- No search highlights yet

**after_search.png**
- Cursor on first "foo" at col 0
- All "foo" occurrences highlighted

**after_nohlsearch.png**
- Cursor still at col 0 on "foo"
- Search highlights cleared
- Text unchanged, search pattern still available for n/N
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('/foo\n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_search');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->ex('nohlsearch');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_nohlsearch');
    },
}
